MODULE: DecommissionReleasesShadowLeaked
TARGET: DecommissionReleases
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: decommission deletes only the generations up to the active one, leaking the partial shadow generation an interrupted rebuild left behind (the pre-fix defect, #4856)
PERTURBS: Delete

--- FIND
    /\ gens' = {}
    /\ shadow' = FALSE
--- REPLACE
    /\ gens' = {}
    /\ shadow' = shadow
--- END